✅ How Dynatrace bills log queries (what we know for sure)
---------------------------------------------------------

Dynatrace log query consumption is based on **GiB scanned** (not results returned). [Dynatrace Documentation](https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/license/capabilities/log-analytics/dps-log-query?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

